<title>SPAIN: Koipe denies Spain share price manipulation charge.</title>
<headline>Koipe denies Spain share price manipulation charge.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish olive oil producer Koipe on Wednesday denied charges by the CNMV stock market commission that it manipulated its share price, saying the company had always acted within the law.</p>
<p>&quot;Koipe believes it acted at all times in conformity with current legislation and in the framework of approved practices...for the acquisition of its own shares, with the sole aim of providing liquidity of the shares in the bourse,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The CNMV earlier said it launched a probe into the share price manipulation and characterised the infraction as &quot;very grave.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585-8341</p>
